{
	chapter.0A943DE399505A98.title: "Client - Municipal Utility"
	chapter.102AEF73B6968C55.title: "Client - Archive \\& Logistics"
	chapter.1B952F0B73A40ABC.title: "First Contracts"
	chapter.1F1CBC61EC8C2CBB.title: "Standing Orders"
	chapter.239F729D7820EB41.title: "Client - Heavy Industry (Nuclear)"
	chapter.255D0CD1EBE456F9.title: "Bandwidth Contracts"
	chapter.305BBDB486C84AF3.title: "The Trading Floor"
	chapter.3550A386DDFC4319.title: "Client - Ferrous Refining"
	chapter.4D607A2A0A4D84B1.title: "Client - Regional Grid"
	chapter.52A1850806116D13.title: "Thermal Compliance"
	chapter.5549AC0BE80403E9.title: "Integration Work"
	chapter.5E308EEF8E82AC69.title: "Client - Atomic Authority"
	chapter.60DC70E8159E7A33.title: "Client - Cogwork Foundry"
	chapter.689279E9C4E15184.title: "Client - Bulk Warehouse"
	chapter.6B21D0F4A73C5E88.title: "Client - Advanced Manufacturing"
	chapter.7DC52BE2F81FD5B7.title: "Client - Heavy Industry"
	chapter_group.16D3370CAB8340A1.title: "Your Data Center"
	chapter_group.3E1FA8DB57AA20D0.title: "Client Work"
	chapter_group.77C03825F033E536.title: "Onboarding"
	quest.00043F4A660BCC54.quest_desc: ["The workhorse tier. Fine for a first trunk, and it will bottleneck you sooner than you expect."]
	quest.00043F4A660BCC54.title: "Contract - Copper Trunk"
	quest.01C9E7069FF761A3.quest_desc: ["A Mekanism operator wants their reactor to run only while your compute is up.", "Place a Compute Interlock and wire its redstone output into the reactor's", "Logic Adapter in ACTIVATION mode."]
	quest.01C9E7069FF761A3.title: "Client Site - Reactor Interlock"
	quest.025255895245FAF2.quest_desc: ["A boiler that runs dry destroys itself.", "The pump goes in before the boiler, not after - the client has lost one already."]
	quest.025255895245FAF2.title: "Site Safety - Feedwater"
	quest.03241B4E003A2068.quest_desc: ["Enough headroom to run a reactor's worth of steam.", "The Atomic Authority's Modern Industrialization licence picks up from here."]
	quest.03241B4E003A2068.title: "Contract 13 - High Voltage"
	quest.03BC4B14C7562630.quest_desc: ["Cracks crude oil into fractions, one output hatch per layer.", "The start of their whole chemistry chain."]
	quest.03BC4B14C7562630.title: "Contract 12 - Distillation"
	quest.03E2A9A221F6A931.quest_desc: ["Pressurised air for diving gear, and fuel for several of their other contraptions."]
	quest.03E2A9A221F6A931.title: "Site Safety - Backtank"
	quest.03F5F31298095AE0.quest_desc: ["Heavy Industry has been granted a nuclear licence and has no ore body to mine.", "That is why they came to you: your Radiation Simulation makes raw uranium out of compute.", "See the Trading Floor if you have not licensed one yet."]
	quest.03F5F31298095AE0.title: "Supply - Raw Uranium"
	quest.04F28AD34367FDD0.quest_desc: ["LWL (Lichtwellenleiter) - single-strand fibre, and a large jump over anything copper.", "This is where your link stops being the limiting factor."]
	quest.04F28AD34367FDD0.title: "Contract - First Fibre"
	quest.051191244EEDF7C4.quest_desc: ["The mid-tier circuit, and the gate to the high-voltage half of the utility's catalogue."]
	quest.051191244EEDF7C4.title: "Component Order - Advanced Circuit"
	quest.05E4E5F3402ABCD9.quest_desc: ["The client has outgrown a single strand. Eight bundled into one run."]
	quest.05E4E5F3402ABCD9.title: "Capacity Order - 8 Strands"
	quest.062D9D8F2CC21EDF.quest_desc: ["The client's complaint is simple: one ore, one ingot, and they are losing money.", "An Enrichment Chamber doubles ore output. It is the first machine any Mekanism site builds", "and the one that pays for all the others."]
	quest.062D9D8F2CC21EDF.title: "Contract 01 - Double the Yield"
	quest.0669C494C953F82B.quest_desc: ["The second circuit tier, assembler-made, and required by everything at MV and above."]
	quest.0669C494C953F82B.title: "Component Order - Electronic Circuit"
	quest.08364F27230E6B38.quest_desc: ["The reactor shell. You will need a great many: this is a large multiblock."]
	quest.08364F27230E6B38.title: "Build 03 - Containment"
	quest.083F6D2F3540E712.quest_desc: ["Links two networks across any distance, or across dimensions.", "The last thing on their list."]
	quest.083F6D2F3540E712.title: "Contract 12 - Quantum Bridge"
	quest.086513D523FCB457.quest_desc: ["Coolant in, hot coolant out. The plumbing side of the same wall."]
	quest.086513D523FCB457.title: "Build 05 - Fluid Hatch"
	quest.0889A96EC45D07E5.quest_desc: ["The reactor's structural material, and none of it is uranium.", "Run this branch alongside the fuel line - the licence needs both before it closes."]
	quest.0889A96EC45D07E5.title: "Build 02 - Nuclear Alloy"
	quest.08F1A7BEF17CF293.quest_desc: ["The top of the standard charger line, and the reason superconductive wire exists."]
	quest.08F1A7BEF17CF293.title: "Tier 03 - High Voltage"
	quest.096D179F21F710AB.quest_desc: ["Flattens ingots into plates - a required step in a surprising number of their recipes."]
	quest.096D179F21F710AB.title: "Contract 02 - Pressing"
	quest.0A414D8B9D5BA072.quest_desc: ["Attach sails and let weather do the work. More output than a water wheel", "if the foundry has the vertical space."]
	quest.0A414D8B9D5BA072.title: "Generation 02 - Wind"
	quest.0A45EBB7B1A2D7FA.quest_desc: ["Smelting without a fuel chain, and considerably faster than a vanilla furnace", "once the grid can feed it."]
	quest.0A45EBB7B1A2D7FA.title: "Contract - Electric Smelting"
	quest.0AB07749C96D0463.quest_desc: ["The client also wants loose material pressed back into whole blocks for shipping.", "That is the Combiner - the Crusher run in reverse."]
	quest.0AB07749C96D0463.title: "Contract 03 - Recombine"
	quest.0B193085EF6ADF0E.quest_desc: ["The other half, and far harder to come by."]
	quest.0B193085EF6ADF0E.title: "Fusion 02 - Tritium"
	quest.0B679530DF4750ED.quest_desc: ["Walk the client through why this install has no redstone in it.", "The rod reads your compute network directly and reports its own insertion depth:", "full compute withdraws it completely, zero compute drives it to 100%."]
	quest.0B679530DF4750ED.title: "Design Review - No Redstone"
	quest.0BE7906EDDF3128A.quest_desc: ["Fibre-tier cable deserves a fibre-tier switch, or the switch becomes the bottleneck", "you just paid to remove from the cable."]
	quest.0BE7906EDDF3128A.title: "Upgrade - Advanced Switch"
	quest.0C2304BBEF8E1E63.quest_desc: ["Low-enriched uranium oxide packed into rods the reactor can actually burn."]
	quest.0C2304BBEF8E1E63.title: "Licence 05 - Fuel Rods"
	quest.0C6861F12FC9BAB2.quest_desc: ["Contracts are not done until the client signs off.", "Confirm the interface is really feeding their network - check the AE2 energy readout", "for incoming FE before you invoice."]
	quest.0C6861F12FC9BAB2.title: "Acceptance Test - ME Power"
	quest.0CF8627D7F79A860.quest_desc: ["Burns solid fuel, or drinks lava directly. The steady baseload option", "for a site that cannot rely on weather."]
	quest.0CF8627D7F79A860.title: "Supply Order 04 - Thermal"
	quest.0D2F5B2C45813C46.quest_desc: ["Copy a contraption with Schematic and Quill, then print it with a Schematicannon.", "The client wants their layout reproducible, not bespoke."]
	quest.0D2F5B2C45813C46.title: "Contract 08 - Schematics"
	quest.0D40E352ACC878CB.quest_desc: ["Minecart contraptions - the foundry moving itself around instead of standing still."]
	quest.0D40E352ACC878CB.title: "Contract 09 - Rolling Stock"
	quest.0DF78880F3214D01.quest_desc: ["Automated extraction across a whole area, filtered by block.", "On a SkyBlock island it is worth less than it sounds - but the client has real ground."]
	quest.0DF78880F3214D01.title: "Contract 05 - Remote Extraction"
	quest.0EA374435FFE14E0.quest_desc: ["Half of the ore-doubling loop runs backwards: the Crusher turns ingots into dust.", "Pair it with the Enrichment Chamber and the loop closes."]
	quest.0EA374435FFE14E0.title: "Contract 02 - Reduce to Dust"
	quest.0F4454D88604DCD4.quest_desc: ["A one-cell drive with a terminal built in. The cheap way to read a single cell", "without committing a whole drive bay to it."]
	quest.0F4454D88604DCD4.title: "Contract 07 - Single Bay"
	quest.106DBFD990649186.quest_desc: ["81 slots. The point where the upgrade path starts to feel worth it."]
	quest.106DBFD990649186.title: "Fit-Out 03 - Gold"
	quest.111DF203C8BB8136.quest_desc: ["Burn fuel, boil water, pipe steam to machines.", "There is no electricity in this era: the boiler is the entire grid."]
	quest.111DF203C8BB8136.title: "Contract 01 - Steam Plant"
	quest.1189639047FAE733.quest_desc: ["Sixteen strands. Your backbone is starting to look like infrastructure."]
	quest.1189639047FAE733.title: "Capacity Order - 16 Strands"
	quest.11CF6A4EA20B0D43.quest_desc: ["Feeds encoded patterns to machines. This is the contract the client actually wanted", "all along: the warehouse makes things by itself."]
	quest.11CF6A4EA20B0D43.title: "Contract 09 - Autocrafting"
	quest.12ECF4739DBBA13A.quest_desc: ["Signal components for someone else's automation project.", "128 dust per delivery, and they pay on the day."]
	quest.12ECF4739DBBA13A.title: "Redstone Requisition"
	quest.13465E1F3D3960CC.quest_desc: ["The Municipal Utility runs a separate voltage-tiered grid from anything else in the pack.", "Everything they order begins as drawn copper wire."]
	quest.13465E1F3D3960CC.title: "Groundwork - Copper Wire"
	quest.15258C587A71E42F.quest_desc: ["Pair a large cogwheel with a small one to change speed.", "Every ratio the foundry uses downstream comes out of this one relationship."]
	quest.15258C587A71E42F.title: "Groundwork - Gear Ratios"
	quest.15417232A0B30E3E.quest_desc: ["Iron plus carbon. Steel is the casing material for nearly every Mekanism multiblock,", "so the client wants a stock of it before any machine is quoted."]
	quest.15417232A0B30E3E.title: "Structural Order - Steel"
	quest.1594861D75068278.quest_desc: ["The contract that makes the site serious: sustain 1,000,000 bytes/tick", "across three or more Racks feeding one Synthesizer or Hosting Rack.", "Take your time. Nothing about this one is quick."]
	quest.1594861D75068278.title: "Tier-1 Client - A Million Bytes"
	quest.15F9A37887A50A52.quest_desc: ["The grid has approved a fission build. Containment comes before fuel, always:", "raise the casing first."]
	quest.15F9A37887A50A52.title: "Nuclear Licence 01 - Containment"
	quest.171CEF05B0140DDF.quest_desc: ["A mechanical hand that uses tools and places blocks exactly as a player would.", "This is where the foundry stops needing an operator standing there."]
	quest.171CEF05B0140DDF.title: "Contract 05 - Deployer"
	quest.1769D5929213F83A.quest_desc: ["Caps the fuel column. A reactor without one is not a reactor, it is an incident."]
	quest.1769D5929213F83A.title: "Nuclear Licence 03 - Control Rods"
	quest.17B6A1D1EFF845C7.quest_desc: ["Fold an entire room into a single cell and put it on a shelf.", "The client did not believe this was possible until you quoted it."]
	quest.17B6A1D1EFF845C7.title: "Contract 11 - Spatial Storage"
	quest.1A59689612E81D41.quest_desc: ["Start it, and confirm it produces steam and power without a meltdown.", "The grid pays on sustained output, not on a successful ignition."]
	quest.1A59689612E81D41.title: "Commissioning - Criticality"
	quest.1ADFE8155206D0F4.quest_desc: ["Splits compounds with current: water into hydrogen and oxygen, and a great deal more."]
	quest.1ADFE8155206D0F4.title: "Contract 08 - Electrolysis"
	quest.1B06466A2A2BFC44.quest_desc: ["For a network that has outgrown the Advanced tier and is now aggregating real traffic."]
	quest.1B06466A2A2BFC44.title: "Upgrade - Core Switch"
	quest.1B40A4E7D4457250.quest_desc: ["Deuterium and tritium fused into plasma.", "It outproduces every fission plant the client owns by an absurd margin."]
	quest.1B40A4E7D4457250.title: "Fusion 04 - Fusion Reactor"
	quest.1B875A5DB7578DDB.quest_desc: ["Natural uranium is mostly useless U-238 with a trace of fissile U-235.", "Only the centrifuge can tell them apart, and it is slow. Build two."]
	quest.1B875A5DB7578DDB.title: "Build 01 - Centrifuge"
	quest.1C6E48F0A9D3B572.quest_desc: ["Bought the wrong part? The Shop's Sell tile takes hardware back at 80% of current price.", "Worn and damaged components fetch less, so dispose of them before they cook."]
	quest.1C6E48F0A9D3B572.title: "Asset Disposal"
	quest.1CA3ECCF3CCA0884.quest_desc: ["The cheapest finding to close out: move the heat somewhere else.", "A Room Fan pushes warm air from the intake room into a cooler exhaust room for 40 FE/tick.", "It only helps if the exhaust side really is cooler - the audit checks that, not the fan count."]
	quest.1CA3ECCF3CCA0884.title: "Remedy 01 - Forced Air"
	quest.1DFE69B7A5F19484.quest_desc: ["The deepest tier the client will ask for by hand: four ingots from one ore.", "Everything past this is factory automation, not new chemistry."]
	quest.1DFE69B7A5F19484.title: "Contract 08 - Four-Times Processing"
	quest.1E0455977E02CF1C.quest_desc: ["The heart of the installation. It supplies the channels every device needs;", "without one the client is limited to a small ad-hoc network."]
	quest.1E0455977E02CF1C.title: "Contract 05 - Controller"
	quest.1E79A44AD33E6546.quest_desc: ["The common leftover. Not fissile, but it bulks out fuel rods", "and eventually breeds into plutonium."]
	quest.1E79A44AD33E6546.title: "Supply - U-238"
	quest.1F49AFA672FF3045.quest_desc: ["Ferrous Refining has signed with you and mines an ore nobody else in the pack touches.", "Get osmium in hand - almost every machine they will ask for is built out of it."]
	quest.1F49AFA672FF3045.title: "Survey the Client's Ore"
	quest.200A1F1D20B3B20C.quest_desc: ["Prove the interlock does what you sold them.", "Kill your compute network deliberately and watch the reactor respond.", "A fail-safe nobody has tested is not a fail-safe."]
	quest.200A1F1D20B3B20C.title: "Acceptance Test - Fail-Safe"
	quest.20C1FB2C281CEE0D.quest_desc: ["Free rotation straight out of a river. Slow, and it never stops."]
	quest.20C1FB2C281CEE0D.title: "Generation 01 - Water"
	quest.210C236D178EDD46.quest_desc: ["The compact unit puts the compressor in the room it is trying to cool. That has a ceiling.", "A split system separates the two: place the Indoor Unit facing the room it serves."]
	quest.210C236D178EDD46.title: "Upgrade - Split System"
	quest.21EC05775E58EA75.quest_desc: ["NuclearScience runs a separate tech tree from Mekanism's fission plant.", "This is the core the rest of the licence hangs off."]
	quest.21EC05775E58EA75.title: "Build 01 - Reactor Core"
	quest.231BB07C79F8A5D6.quest_desc: ["Rotational force has to travel somehow. Cogwheels are that somehow."]
	quest.231BB07C79F8A5D6.title: "Groundwork - Cogwheel"
	quest.2353E228AE2DBDC3.quest_desc: ["The reactor makes steam, not electricity. The turbine is what makes it worth money."]
	quest.2353E228AE2DBDC3.title: "Build 04 - Turbine Hall"
	quest.249748CB5EC8752E.quest_desc: ["Power, hashrate, a sale. You are a going concern.", "Place a Task Screen and bind it to a Standing Order - that block is your goods-in bay, ", "and it takes deliveries straight from a pipe instead of a menu click.", "The other chapters are client work: cooling, bandwidth, and the trading floor."]
	quest.249748CB5EC8752E.title: "Open for Business"
	quest.2528C4CB603E1EFF.quest_desc: ["The stronger shell. Same recipes as bronze, run faster."]
	quest.2528C4CB603E1EFF.title: "Groundwork - Steel Casing"
	quest.268D9454E0DA2D33.quest_desc: ["Fuel rods in, depleted rods out. An ordinary machine hatch will not survive here."]
	quest.268D9454E0DA2D33.title: "Build 04 - Item Hatch"
	quest.275D4F43B71A1CBC.quest_desc: ["Before you trade anything, learn how the board moves.", "Open the Shop and read the current prices - they track the real historical calendar", "to the day, not a random walk. Nothing here is luck."]
	quest.275D4F43B71A1CBC.title: "Desk Briefing"
	quest.27ABBC340B34FA9A.quest_desc: ["Automated crafting, arranged as a powered grid.", "Fiddly to lay out, and it is what the whole chapter has been building toward."]
	quest.27ABBC340B34FA9A.title: "Contract 06 - Crafting Grid"
	quest.27AF5C3326942313.quest_desc: ["Separating U-235 from U-238 is the whole difficulty of nuclear power.", "The centrifuge is slow by design. Build more than one."]
	quest.27AF5C3326942313.title: "Licence 03 - Enrichment"
	quest.27C0CFAE0D622DBE.quest_desc: ["The ring's building block. The reactor needs a great many of them."]
	quest.27C0CFAE0D622DBE.title: "Fusion 03 - Containment Ring"
	quest.27FEB3896099179C.quest_desc: ["Every chest on the same colour code shares one inventory, at any distance", "and across dimensions. Two sites, one stockroom."]
	quest.27FEB3896099179C.title: "Logistics 02 - Shared Inventory"
	quest.29AF5F6643FFB222.quest_desc: ["Line the reactor room. This is the item that decides whether the site", "is a power plant or a slow accident."]
	quest.29AF5F6643FFB222.title: "Build 03 - Shielding"
	quest.2A7F5C2BB987450A.quest_desc: ["Output scales with build height, so where you put it matters more than how many you build."]
	quest.2A7F5C2BB987450A.title: "Supply Order 02 - Wind"
	quest.2AB55D0C0399B519.quest_desc: ["Holds storage cells and puts their contents onto the network.", "This is the moment the warehouse becomes searchable."]
	quest.2AB55D0C0399B519.title: "Contract 06 - Drive Bay"
	quest.2CB31197439BC931.quest_desc: ["Item, fluid and gas into one chamber. The PRC is the gateway to Mekanism's chemistry", "and to the deeper ore tiers."]
	quest.2CB31197439BC931.title: "Contract 07 - Pressure Work"
	quest.2CD2993ED43FECF5.quest_desc: ["Contact plating. Small volume, better rate, and they only order every other day."]
	quest.2CD2993ED43FECF5.title: "Precious Metals Order"
	quest.2CDB52D5585D309A.quest_desc: ["Peak demand does not match peak supply. An Induction Matrix is the buffer", "that lets the grid buy from them at all - and it scales as far as they can afford."]
	quest.2CDB52D5585D309A.title: "Storage Contract - Induction Matrix"
	quest.2CDB55EA8EE660E4.quest_desc: ["The hottest thing a fission reactor will accept,", "and genuinely dangerous if the cooling loop cannot keep up."]
	quest.2CDB55EA8EE660E4.title: "Cycle 04 - High-Enriched MOX"
	quest.2DDE0E8056E313CF.quest_desc: ["A Mining Rig will mine whatever you point it at, but only coins the calendar has reached.", "Choose an algorithm and commit the hardware to it."]
	quest.2DDE0E8056E313CF.title: "Position - Pick an Algorithm"
	quest.2EB0A6552045F1F3.quest_desc: ["The last switch tier. Fed by a superconducting run and a full core,", "this is the box a carrier peers with rather than buys from."]
	quest.2EB0A6552045F1F3.title: "Tier-1 Peering"
	quest.2F0BA190D9A9551B.quest_desc: ["A local fabricator buys iron in rack-unit lots and doesn't ask where it came from.", "Synthesise 64 ingots and feed them into a Task Screen wired to this contract -", "deliveries are physical here, the order book won't take them off your belt.", "Standing order: they will want another batch tomorrow."]
	quest.2F0BA190D9A9551B.title: "Scrap Steel Order"
	quest.30857795C3E80586.quest_desc: ["A terminal with a grid attached, so staff craft straight out of network storage", "instead of hauling materials to a bench."]
	quest.30857795C3E80586.title: "Contract 08 - Crafting Terminal"
	quest.31DD698891DD3B26.quest_desc: ["Deuterium oxide, electrolysed out of ordinary water.", "A reactor moderated with it runs hotter and burns fuel better."]
	quest.31DD698891DD3B26.title: "Coolant 01 - Heavy Water"
	quest.325DE6F2F0A25146.quest_desc: ["Grinds ore into dust and doubles the yield.", "On an island where every ore is synthesised, doubling is worth more than usual."]
	quest.325DE6F2F0A25146.title: "Contract 03 - Ore Doubling"
	quest.32E888D32D7ADED0.quest_desc: ["Archive \\& Logistics wants their whole warehouse turned into one searchable system.", "All of it starts with certus quartz, grown in water rather than mined."]
	quest.32E888D32D7ADED0.title: "Intake - Certus Quartz"
	quest.33588275A20FD917.quest_desc: ["The first circuit tier. From here on their machines need brains as well as casings."]
	quest.33588275A20FD917.title: "Component Order - Analog Circuit"
	quest.3387E54E295D8C2A.quest_desc: ["Their easiest ask: generation with no fuel chain at all.", "Weak per panel, and it scales by simply building more."]
	quest.3387E54E295D8C2A.title: "Supply Order 01 - Daylight"
	quest.33BAF41AC05BC5D1.quest_desc: ["Nobody pays for a dark rack. Feed it power and get a processor running", "until the readout shows real bytes/tick.", "Everything else on this board depends on this one number being above zero."]
	quest.33BAF41AC05BC5D1.title: "Get the Rack Breathing"
	quest.35957D2B5FF59169.quest_desc: ["The last sign-off on the board. Drop your compute and confirm the rod drives in", "and shuts the reactor down on its own.", "Then you have sold a safety system, not a gadget."]
	quest.35957D2B5FF59169.title: "Acceptance Test - SCRAM"
	quest.3850044BF7EFF533.quest_desc: ["Filters load up. An Air Duster clears accumulated dust out of a machine", "and resets it to a clean baseline.", "Book it as routine work, not an emergency - emergencies cost hardware."]
	quest.3850044BF7EFF533.title: "Scheduled Maintenance"
	quest.387A86B1E3A4B2C5.quest_desc: ["The site now produces more than it can shelve.", "A QIO Drive Array gives them one searchable pool instead of a wall of chests."]
	quest.387A86B1E3A4B2C5.title: "Contract 09 - Quantum Storage"
	quest.39BBBB4DE0F711CA.quest_desc: ["The common isotope, and most of what yellowcake yields. Not fissile on its own."]
	quest.39BBBB4DE0F711CA.title: "Licence 02 - U-238"
	quest.3C23A8ED1599F165.quest_desc: ["The reactor's only interface to the outside world.", "Your own Cross-Mod contracts hang off this block - see Integration Work."]
	quest.3C23A8ED1599F165.title: "Nuclear Licence 04 - Logic Adapter"
	quest.3C51FE6E19CE5C67.quest_desc: ["U-235 and U-238 packed into one rod. Barely a snack for the reactor they want."]
	quest.3C51FE6E19CE5C67.title: "Fuel 01 - Single Rod"
	quest.3CB8D18FD763B4F4.quest_desc: ["Simple, reliable, and dirty. The first thing they will actually run."]
	quest.3CB8D18FD763B4F4.title: "Generation 01 - Coal"
	quest.3CBB6400FB4FACA3.quest_desc: ["The audit found particulates. Dust settles on components, insulates them, and drives temperatures up", "until something throttles or fails.", "Fit a Dust Filter and keep the intake clean."]
	quest.3CBB6400FB4FACA3.title: "Remedy 02 - Filtration"
	quest.3E53AAD4D49822AD.quest_desc: ["Sixty-four strands in a single run. At this point the cable costs more than the room."]
	quest.3E53AAD4D49822AD.title: "Capacity Order - 64 Strands"
	quest.3F7C9D74072B65DF.quest_desc: ["The top of the catalogue. Nothing you own will saturate it,", "which is exactly what a tier-1 customer is paying for."]
	quest.3F7C9D74072B65DF.title: "Contract - Superconducting Run"
	quest.41645E71442C2507.quest_desc: ["The Authority has heard what your data center can do and wants it wired in.", "The Compute Control Rod sits under the core and reads your network directly.", "This is the same contract as Integration Work, seen from the client's side."]
	quest.41645E71442C2507.title: "Integration - Compute Control Rod"
	quest.41C9944A50E23035.quest_desc: ["Steps the grid up for machines an LV line cannot feed."]
	quest.41C9944A50E23035.title: "Tier 02 - Medium Voltage"
	quest.428A259718521000.quest_desc: ["Charge it on the LV Charger and carry the power to whatever needs it.", "The utility's answer before they have a distribution grid."]
	quest.428A259718521000.title: "Tier 01 - Storage"
	quest.44687105BB34829E.quest_desc: ["The Atomic Authority licenses reactor builds and will not skip a step.", "Milled uranium concentrate is where every application starts."]
	quest.44687105BB34829E.title: "Licence 01 - Yellowcake"
	quest.44BCB1E70770FB4A.quest_desc: ["Rotational output for the machines that need moving parts, not just current."]
	quest.44BCB1E70770FB4A.title: "Component Order - Motor"
	quest.44C14352A4A70550.quest_desc: ["Selling by hand through a GUI does not scale.", "Pipe goods into a Log Buyer and let the desk clear itself."]
	quest.44C14352A4A70550.title: "Automate the Timber Desk"
	quest.44F4495500D8452E.quest_desc: ["Not waste. There is still plutonium bound up in every one of these."]
	quest.44F4495500D8452E.title: "Cycle 01 - Spent Fuel"
	quest.458DA09616CCB238.quest_desc: ["Idle compute earns nothing. Point a Mining Rig at an algorithm the calendar has actually", "reached and let it work.", "This is the first contract that pays you while you're away from the keyboard."]
	quest.458DA09616CCB238.title: "First Billable Hashrate"
	quest.45FA19C59F40232B.quest_desc: ["Their first real step up in throughput."]
	quest.45FA19C59F40232B.title: "Contract 10 - Medium Voltage"
	quest.460912E0B3AE27F6.quest_desc: ["Their own ore, and half of the alloy every advanced contract needs."]
	quest.460912E0B3AE27F6.title: "Materials Order - Zinc"
	quest.4639F9A69D6C87FC.quest_desc: ["A shell company owns this island, a single rack, and nothing else.", "You've just signed for all three.", "From here on you don't mine, farm, or explore - you sell compute, and buy everything else.", "Sign, and the first client goes on the board."]
	quest.4639F9A69D6C87FC.title: "Contract 001 - Take the Lease"
	quest.46B7B1E5D0D3DCA4.quest_desc: ["Moves items between inventories on rules you define.", "The foundry's answer to belts they do not want to build."]
	quest.46B7B1E5D0D3DCA4.title: "Contract 07 - Item Routing"
	quest.46CD7F1E4095DA99.quest_desc: ["Bind a module to a specific rod and drive its insertion depth from 0 to 100% -", "by hand, or from an external signal."]
	quest.46CD7F1E4095DA99.title: "Contract - Rod Module"
	quest.4852A4F8B4CE102B.quest_desc: ["Their network needs FE brought in. An Energy Acceptor is the intake point -", "and the block your own AE2 Power Interface contract feeds."]
	quest.4852A4F8B4CE102B.title: "Contract 04 - Power Intake"
	quest.499F63A8CEF6786A.quest_desc: ["Mines a whole area on steam alone. Optional here, and the client has real ground", "even if you do not."]
	quest.499F63A8CEF6786A.title: "Contract 04 - Steam Quarry"
	quest.4A7C1E9D6B25F308.quest_desc: ["Uranium and thorium never appear in the Miner Sim's output - they are licensed separately.", "The Radiation Simulation produces them from compute, and what comes out is genuinely hot:", "carry it unshielded and you will find out how hot. Store the output properly."]
	quest.4A7C1E9D6B25F308.title: "Licensed Contract - Radioisotopes"
	quest.4AB577BBFADF07C5.quest_desc: ["The multiblock itself. Rods sit in a grid and heat their neighbours,", "so the arrangement decides whether the client gets power or an incident.", "Read the layout in the guide before switching it on."]
	quest.4AB577BBFADF07C5.title: "Build 06 - Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.4BD3B633F5880CBE.quest_desc: ["Zero-loss transmission. The utility's last order, and the only cable", "that will not waste what an HV line delivers."]
	quest.4BD3B633F5880CBE.title: "Final Contract - Superconducting Grid"
	quest.4BF4A486223E73EF.quest_desc: ["A run is point-to-point. A switch is a network.", "Place a Standard Switch and keep it powered - the backplane draws FE of its own."]
	quest.4BF4A486223E73EF.title: "Site Equipment - Switch"
	quest.4C7F0639CD86C14C.quest_desc: ["The component gate for almost every Electrodynamics machine.", "Budget for a lot of these; nothing here is built without them."]
	quest.4C7F0639CD86C14C.title: "Groundwork - Basic Circuit"
	quest.4E03FFFC19A89C61.quest_desc: ["The steam furnace's successor. Add energy hatches to raise its temperature,", "and that temperature is what gates the high-tier alloys."]
	quest.4E03FFFC19A89C61.title: "Contract 11 - Electric Blast Furnace"
	quest.4F14ACE58B13C294.quest_desc: ["The whole network in a pocket. Needs an Access Point in range to talk to."]
	quest.4F14ACE58B13C294.title: "Contract 10 - Wireless Access"
	quest.4F6B7EE33A7C46C5.quest_desc: ["The desk wants you liquid. Sell any mined coin through the Wallet, then tick this off.", "Note: the mod tracks coin as a wallet balance rather than an item,", "so this one runs on the honour system for now."]
	quest.4F6B7EE33A7C46C5.title: "Realise a Position"
	quest.5002150D924551DF.quest_desc: ["Where the refrigerant line crosses a wall you need a proper seal,", "or the hole you just made undoes the room you just sealed."]
	quest.5002150D924551DF.title: "Site Works - Wall Penetration"
	quest.508F32CDDA079039.quest_desc: ["A different reactor design entirely, and a considerably more forgiving one."]
	quest.508F32CDDA079039.title: "Licence 06 - Molten Salt"
	quest.5160E7EBBC4B389C.quest_desc: ["A second operator, a different reactor mod, and a much cleaner mechanism.", "The Compute Control Rod is a real block that goes under the NuclearScience reactor core -", "no comparator, no inverter, no wiring at all."]
	quest.5160E7EBBC4B389C.title: "Client Site - Control Rod Contract"
	quest.51888B790DB0B03C.quest_desc: ["The grid's endgame contract. It needs a fission plant running first", "just to reach ignition temperature."]
	quest.51888B790DB0B03C.title: "Advanced Licence - Fusion"
	quest.5200BABB195DDE1D.quest_desc: ["Rather than mine, rent the capacity out. A Hosting Rack turns compute into income", "with no exposure to the coin price at all.", "Boring, steady, and it pays while the market is down."]
	quest.5200BABB195DDE1D.title: "Contract - Managed Hosting"
	quest.5210FC1BF9176380.quest_desc: ["Burns bio fuel rendered from plant matter. Fully renewable if the client has a farm,", "and dead weight if they do not."]
	quest.5210FC1BF9176380.title: "Supply Order 03 - Biomass"
	quest.5224B91C82DD3FC3.quest_desc: ["Raise the per-drawer capacity until the wall holds the client's actual throughput."]
	quest.5224B91C82DD3FC3.title: "Bulk 02 - Capacity Upgrades"
	quest.525908781BDD5B6C.quest_desc: ["One machine per recipe does not scale. A Tier I Factory runs several inputs at once", "and is the point where the client's site stops being a workshop."]
	quest.525908781BDD5B6C.title: "Contract 06 - Scale the Line"
	quest.543DE59911AE759C.quest_desc: ["Certus, redstone and nether quartz fused together. AE2's signature material."]
	quest.543DE59911AE759C.title: "Intake - Fluix"
	quest.544234132060F7B3.quest_desc: ["Mixed oxide: plutonium blended back in with uranium.", "Burns hotter than uranium and turns a waste stream into a fuel stream."]
	quest.544234132060F7B3.title: "Cycle 03 - MOX Fuel"
	quest.5449E2276A7B20CB.quest_desc: ["The Regional Grid will not talk to a site that cannot store what it makes.", "A Basic Energy Cube is the meter and buffer they want installed first."]
	quest.5449E2276A7B20CB.title: "Metering Contract"
	quest.5517FAECDFC43603.quest_desc: ["The Millstone's larger sibling: two wheels facing each other,", "and the foundry's first real throughput."]
	quest.5517FAECDFC43603.title: "Contract 04 - Bulk Crushing"
	quest.5562580BEE101880.quest_desc: ["Deuterium and tritium. The only thing a fusion reactor will accept,", "and considerably harder to source than uranium."]
	quest.5562580BEE101880.title: "Advanced Licence - D-T Fuel"
	quest.56044B55F8D9066C.quest_desc: ["One machine is a hobby. Assemble another Server and put it to work -", "capacity is the only thing on this floor you can actually sell."]
	quest.56044B55F8D9066C.title: "Capex - Another Rack Unit"
	quest.56110CF1FD95616C.quest_desc: ["Heavy Industry starts before electricity, and before machines.", "The Forge Hammer turns ingots into plates by hand. Everything they order later", "is downstream of this one tool."]
	quest.56110CF1FD95616C.title: "Groundwork - Forge Hammer"
	quest.56401D4E34835FEC.quest_desc: ["A carrier is shopping for capacity and wants to know what you can actually deliver.", "Find the bandwidth readout and learn what your current run is rated for.", "Everything they order from here is priced against that ceiling."]
	quest.56401D4E34835FEC.title: "Link Survey"
	quest.56A750CCE09CE7CB.quest_desc: ["A neighbouring site runs an ME network and keeps browning it out.", "Install an AE2 Power Interface and bridge your FE into their network."]
	quest.56A750CCE09CE7CB.title: "Client Site - ME Network Power"
	quest.56B6A9AD2C7E82C0.quest_desc: ["Cable plant down the coast, permanently short on copper.", "Lower margin than steel, but they never stop ordering."]
	quest.56B6A9AD2C7E82C0.title: "Copper Requisition"
	quest.58277F7F739221BF.quest_desc: ["The fissile isotope, and the rare one. Every fuel rod the Authority approves needs it."]
	quest.58277F7F739221BF.title: "Licence 04 - U-235"
	quest.598A71A36A5C4B17.quest_desc: ["Infuses items with carbon, redstone or diamond. This is how Mekanism makes every alloy", "the later contracts assume you already have."]
	quest.598A71A36A5C4B17.title: "Contract 04 - Alloys on Demand"
	quest.5A043973609B8155.quest_desc: ["Four rods bundled. This is what the Nuclear Reactor actually expects to be fed."]
	quest.5A043973609B8155.title: "Fuel 02 - Quad Rod"
	quest.5B08A07C97E956FD.quest_desc: ["Fuelled, rodded, shielded, and turning a turbine.", "The Authority signs off on a reactor that runs clean, not one that merely runs."]
	quest.5B08A07C97E956FD.title: "Commissioning - Run Clean"
	quest.5B83D1D203CF077C.quest_desc: ["A SkyBlock island has no ore. Sim blocks solve that: they eat compute", "and produce real materials on a timer.", "Get one running and you have a supply line instead of a shopping list."]
	quest.5B83D1D203CF077C.title: "Contract - Simulated Extraction"
	quest.5BF8A52E70148BCB.quest_desc: ["Macerate the raw ore. Dust is the only form the centrifuge can separate."]
	quest.5BF8A52E70148BCB.title: "Supply - Uranium Dust"
	quest.5C28CE047E2D68E1.quest_desc: ["Chests are wrong for bulk. Drawers hold enormous quantities of one item,", "and a Controller makes a whole wall of them behave as a single inventory."]
	quest.5C28CE047E2D68E1.title: "Bulk 01 - Drawer Controller"
	quest.5DB34E242C9EA954.quest_desc: ["Curtain walling for an office block. Bulk, cheap, and endlessly repeatable."]
	quest.5DB34E242C9EA954.title: "Bulk Glass Order"
	quest.5DD80B9720E3A611.quest_desc: ["Their first multiblock: a hollow box of heatproof casing with hatches in the walls.", "It makes the alloys plain smelting cannot, and it gates the electric age."]
	quest.5DD80B9720E3A611.title: "Contract 05 - Blast Furnace"
	quest.5E5E4BA5E1F2F885.quest_desc: ["Iron and carbon. Steel opens the second machine tier."]
	quest.5E5E4BA5E1F2F885.title: "Materials Order - Steel"
	quest.5EF22337940659FB.quest_desc: ["The Outdoor Unit does the actual compressor work at 180 FE/tick and dumps heat outside.", "Put it anywhere with exhaust access - the roof, the yard, off the island edge."]
	quest.5EF22337940659FB.title: "Site Works - Condenser"
	quest.5F80B3D71E9A46C2.quest_desc: ["Building a second identical machine part by part is wasted effort.", "Drop an assembled Server into the Shop's Reorder tile and buy a pristine duplicate", "at current part prices plus 5%."]
	quest.5F80B3D71E9A46C2.title: "Procurement - Repeat Order"
	quest.5FE0C9D8F053A788.quest_desc: ["ME cable carries items, channels and power in the same run -", "which is why an AE2 network is wired differently from anything else in the pack."]
	quest.5FE0C9D8F053A788.title: "Contract 03 - Cabling"
	quest.6002C9E3F81B7A45.quest_desc: ["A manufacturing group has outgrown its own tooling. They already run a bronze and steel", "plant on site and want the extended line commissioned on top of it.", "Sign here and the parts orders start arriving."]
	quest.6002C9E3F81B7A45.title: "Client Brief - Advanced Manufacturing"
	quest.600593C7F036F48A.quest_desc: ["Their plate press is a forge hammer and one very tired employee.", "A Bronze Bending Machine turns ingots into plates and curved plates without the swing."]
	quest.600593C7F036F48A.title: "Retooling - Bronze Bending"
	quest.60085DABE8526ECF.quest_desc: ["Ore in, dust out, at several times the throughput of the single-block unit.", "It wants a serious steam supply - size the boiler before you size the multiblock."]
	quest.60085DABE8526ECF.title: "Volume Order - Steam Maceration"
	quest.600B278FE06DE914.quest_desc: ["The same multiblock trick applied to smelting: parallel processing, one steam line.", "Pairs with the macerator - crush, then cook, without a single cable on site."]
	quest.600B278FE06DE914.title: "Volume Order - Steam Smelting"
	quest.600DF173D8896359.quest_desc: ["Fuel deliveries are this client's largest recurring cost.", "A Bronze Solar Boiler makes steam out of daylight instead. Slower, free, and it never", "runs dry at three in the morning."]
	quest.600DF173D8896359.title: "Site Works - Solar Boiler"
	quest.6010BB57D0A4DD9E.quest_desc: ["Second-tier press. Faster, higher throughput, and it takes the electric upgrade later.", "Steel is where this client's plant stops being a hobby."]
	quest.6010BB57D0A4DD9E.title: "Retooling - Steel Bending"
	quest.6013853BC8C057E3.quest_desc: ["Alloying by hand does not scale. This one runs two inputs into one output on a schedule,", "and every tier above it is the same machine with a bigger power bill."]
	quest.6013853BC8C057E3.title: "Retooling - Steel Alloy Smelter"
	quest.60164F1FC0DBD228.quest_desc: ["Fluids into cells, food into cans. The site canteen is written into the contract.", "It is also the only sane way to move their fluids off-site."]
	quest.60164F1FC0DBD228.title: "Contract - Canning Line"
	quest.60191903B8F74C6D.quest_desc: ["Prove the line works: press a tin can, fill it, hand it over.", "The inspector eats the sample. That is the whole test."]
	quest.60191903B8F74C6D.title: "Acceptance Test - Canned Rations"
	quest.601BE2E7B112C6B2.quest_desc: ["Fermentation for the agriculture side of the plant. Sugar in, useful liquid out.", "The client is quite specific that this is a process unit and not a bar."]
	quest.601BE2E7B112C6B2.title: "Contract - Brewery"
	quest.601EACCBA92E40F7.quest_desc: ["Steam gets you to steel. It does not get you past it.", "Run the first cable to the press line and take the speed."]
	quest.601EACCBA92E40F7.title: "Electrification - Bending"
	quest.602176AFA149BB3C.quest_desc: ["Same job, electric, and now it will accept overclock upgrades.", "From here the client's tier list is only a question of how much power you can deliver."]
	quest.602176AFA149BB3C.title: "Electrification - Alloy Smelter"
	quest.6024409399653581.quest_desc: ["The large furnace again, without the boiler.", "Parallel smelting, scaled by how many energy hatches you are willing to feed."]
	quest.6024409399653581.title: "Volume Order - Electric Smelting"
	quest.60270A779180AFC6.quest_desc: ["The other half of the ore line. Same multiblock, same appetite for amps."]
	quest.60270A779180AFC6.title: "Volume Order - Electric Maceration"
	quest.6029D45B899C2A0B.quest_desc: ["The client is tired of hoppers. A Machine Chainer drives a whole row of identical", "machines from one input face. Line them up, chain them, feed the front."]
	quest.6029D45B899C2A0B.title: "Automation - Machine Chainer"
	quest.602C9E3F81B7A450.quest_desc: ["One multiblock that pretends to be many machines at once.", "Slot in the machine you want it to imitate and it runs that recipe in parallel.", "This is the end of the client's throughput problem."]
	quest.602C9E3F81B7A450.title: "Automation - Processing Array"
	quest.602F682379D31E95.quest_desc: ["Wireless power starts here. Copper first - nobody funds a superconductor winding", "before they have seen a spark jump."]
	quest.602F682379D31E95.title: "Research - Tesla Winding"
	quest.6032320771EE98DA.quest_desc: ["Windings stacked into a coil. It throws energy a short distance through open air.", "Stand back during commissioning. The lethal variant exists for a reason."]
	quest.6032320771EE98DA.title: "Prototype - Tesla Coil"
	quest.6034FBEB6A0A131F.quest_desc: ["The transmitter. Power goes in by cable at one site and comes out of the air at another.", "No trench, no cable run, no right-of-way to negotiate.", "This is what the client actually bought."]
	quest.6034FBEB6A0A131F.title: "Site Works - Tesla Tower"
	quest.6037C5CF62258D64.quest_desc: ["A receiver hatch turns a broadcasting tower into usable machine power.", "Start at LV, on one machine, and confirm the tower actually reaches it before you scale."]
	quest.6037C5CF62258D64.title: "Commissioning - LV Receiver"
	quest.603A8FB35A4107A9.quest_desc: ["Same link, several tiers of headroom.", "Now the wireless grid can run a multiblock instead of a lamp."]
	quest.603A8FB35A4107A9.title: "Upgrade - HV Receiver"
	quest.603D5997525C81EE.quest_desc: ["A receiver small enough to carry. Tools charge off the tower while the engineer walks", "the site. The client's maintenance crew will never plug anything in again."]
	quest.603D5997525C81EE.title: "Field Kit - Handheld Receiver"
	quest.6040237B4A77FC33.quest_desc: ["A panel is mostly cell. Get the cell line running before you quote them a roof."]
	quest.6040237B4A77FC33.title: "Supply - Photovoltaic Cells"
	quest.6042ED5F42937678.quest_desc: ["Daylight into power. No fuel, no throughput, no attention.", "Quiet baseline supply for the plant's idle load."]
	quest.6042ED5F42937678.title: "Site Works - LV Solar Array"
	quest.6045B7433AAEF0BD.quest_desc: ["Same roof, several tiers up. Expensive per panel, and the only power on this site that", "costs nothing at all to run."]
	quest.6045B7433AAEF0BD.title: "Upgrade - HV Solar Array"
	quest.6048812732CA6B02.quest_desc: ["Plant waste back into manure. The agriculture side of this client either pays for", "itself or it gets cancelled at the next board meeting."]
	quest.6048812732CA6B02.title: "Contract - Composting"
	quest.604B4B0B2AE5E547.quest_desc: ["Manure, phosphoric acid, potassium. Chemistry the client would rather you did quietly", "and downwind of the offices."]
	quest.604B4B0B2AE5E547.title: "Process - NPK Fertilizer"
	quest.604E14EF23015F8C.quest_desc: ["Plant, fertilize, harvest, repeat, without a villager in sight.", "Feed it the fertilizer line and the field runs itself."]
	quest.604E14EF23015F8C.title: "Automation - Electric Farmer"
	quest.604E65E5E61D631F.quest_desc: ["Reactor output is far too much for an HV turbine to swallow.", "The Large Steam Turbine is what converts it into money."]
	quest.604E65E5E61D631F.title: "Build 07 - Turbine Hall"
	quest.6050DED31B1CD9D1.quest_desc: ["The client's security detail asked for something with a battery in it.", "Charge it off the tower and it never needs a socket."]
	quest.6050DED31B1CD9D1.title: "Delivery - Nano Saber"
	quest.6053A8B713385416.quest_desc: ["Powered armour straight off their own production line.", "Sign-off here means the plant can build things it could not have imagined at bronze tier."]
	quest.6053A8B713385416.title: "Delivery - Nano Suit"
	quest.613043FEDAAA4D79.quest_desc: ["Reprocessed out of depleted rods. The client's reactor has started feeding itself."]
	quest.613043FEDAAA4D79.title: "Cycle 02 - Plutonium"
	quest.626C39B7B5E8DC01.quest_desc: ["Combines fluids and items into products no furnace could make."]
	quest.626C39B7B5E8DC01.title: "Contract 09 - Chemical Reactor"
	quest.629D29B2DF66D86F.quest_desc: ["A small closing courtesy: a Robit that follows the operator and crafts on request.", "Not essential, and the client asked for it anyway."]
	quest.629D29B2DF66D86F.title: "Contract 10 - Site Assistant"
	quest.631ED9AA24350856.quest_desc: ["Automating a reactor from outside needs its own small network:", "a Fission Interface bound to the core, logistics cable, and a controller."]
	quest.631ED9AA24350856.title: "Contract - Remote Control"
	quest.63B72EED503C21BB.quest_desc: ["Mined coin is not money until you sell it. Open the Wallet and realise a position", "at the current historical price.", "Prices follow the real market to the day - selling is a decision, not a formality."]
	quest.63B72EED503C21BB.title: "Settle Your First Position"
	quest.63CC9ED9319BF0EC.quest_desc: ["Your underwriter will not quote a premium on a site nobody has measured.", "Open a Rack and read its temperature and wattage off the panel.", "Every remedy on this board is judged against the number you find today."]
	quest.63CC9ED9319BF0EC.title: "Thermal Audit: Baseline"
	quest.648ABF25DC9A5F86.quest_desc: ["Tells the operator how irradiated a spot is before the spot tells them."]
	quest.648ABF25DC9A5F86.title: "Site Safety - Survey Meter"
	quest.6565B62D90DB5AE6.quest_desc: ["Non-negotiable before the Authority signs anything.", "Handle enriched material without it and the contract ends early, along with other things."]
	quest.6565B62D90DB5AE6.title: "Site Safety - Hazmat"
	quest.6639FC41631ED64B.quest_desc: ["You start with one tree and no capital. The Log Buyer takes logs, sticks and saplings", "at market rate - it's not a business, it's seed money.", "Clear the tree and turn it into your first dollars."]
	quest.6639FC41631ED64B.title: "Liquidate the Timber"
	quest.67DDACF5537C6BCC.quest_desc: ["The third circuit tier - and the one the nuclear licence is waiting on."]
	quest.67DDACF5537C6BCC.title: "Component Order - Digital Circuit"
	quest.6807AAA1A0FFCB30.quest_desc: ["The top tier, and you can see the contents from outside -", "which matters more on a warehouse floor than the slot count does."]
	quest.6807AAA1A0FFCB30.title: "Fit-Out 05 - Crystal"
	quest.68CFC9728BED7721.quest_desc: ["Calculation, logic and engineering processors.", "Tedious to set up, and everything downstream is made of them."]
	quest.68CFC9728BED7721.title: "Contract 02 - Processors"
	quest.69154A789DC8E21A.quest_desc: ["Faster than a vanilla furnace, and it burns no fuel of its own."]
	quest.69154A789DC8E21A.title: "Contract 02 - Steam Smelting"
	quest.69C4565E845D2B03.quest_desc: ["Brakes. The Authority checks for these before it checks for fuel."]
	quest.69C4565E845D2B03.title: "Build 02 - Control Rods"
	quest.6A92C9384444795F.quest_desc: ["Moving air only works while there is somewhere cooler to move it to.", "An Air Conditioner makes cold instead of relocating heat - the first real answer", "once your whole room has warmed up."]
	quest.6A92C9384444795F.title: "Remedy 03 - Active Cooling"
	quest.6B79FF2FEBE85BC0.quest_desc: ["A client complaint has been logged: throughput dropped without a hardware change.", "Block a Rack's front intake and watch the capacity fall, so you can recognise it on sight.", "Reproduce the fault, then clear it."]
	quest.6B79FF2FEBE85BC0.title: "Fault Report - Blocked Intake"
	quest.6C8C74C50A00346F.quest_desc: ["Presses circuit patterns into silicon. The client cannot have a network", "until they can print their own processors."]
	quest.6C8C74C50A00346F.title: "Contract 01 - Inscriber"
	quest.6DC93476A859F350.quest_desc: ["54 slots - a double chest in a single block, and no double-chest footprint to plan around."]
	quest.6DC93476A859F350.title: "Fit-Out 02 - Iron"
	quest.6DD12415C8716FB7.quest_desc: ["Run the crystals through a Charger. Needed for fluix,", "and fluix gates every single thing this client will ask for."]
	quest.6DD12415C8716FB7.title: "Intake - Charged Certus"
	quest.6E787D2E63E03FFE.quest_desc: ["Copper and tin. Their entire steam age is built out of it."]
	quest.6E787D2E63E03FFE.title: "Materials Order - Bronze"
	quest.6EDFBD230A821347.quest_desc: ["The fissile isotope, and the rare one. Every fuel rod needs it."]
	quest.6EDFBD230A821347.title: "Supply - U-235"
	quest.6FFE9564ECCDFB5C.quest_desc: ["Spent fuel is not waste. Reprocess it and the site starts feeding itself."]
	quest.6FFE9564ECCDFB5C.title: "Licence 07 - Reprocessing"
	quest.7035D7A897BAC5CD.quest_desc: ["Cutting tools. This is the most your synthesiser will ever be worth per unit -", "and the slowest contract on the board to come back around."]
	quest.7035D7A897BAC5CD.title: "Industrial Diamonds"
	quest.71872353B0135F54.quest_desc: ["Fuel it, cool it, and route the steam into the turbine.", "Then watch the heat readout for a full minute before walking away.", "A reactor that runs hot for a minute runs hot forever - until it does not."]
	quest.71872353B0135F54.title: "Commissioning - Going Critical"
	quest.71991DAC5F19CD04.quest_desc: ["Heavy hydrogen, centrifuged out of heavy water. Half of a fusion fuel mix."]
	quest.71991DAC5F19CD04.title: "Fusion 01 - Deuterium"
	quest.71A361F851BDD154.quest_desc: ["Grinds ore and crops with no power grid at all.", "Cheap, slow, and the first processing the foundry can actually afford."]
	quest.71A361F851BDD154.title: "Contract 01 - Milling"
	quest.723151349EB66865.quest_desc: ["The cheapest cable in the catalogue, and the right answer for a short run", "that nobody is going to saturate.", "Start here so you can feel the difference when you stop using it."]
	quest.723151349EB66865.title: "Contract - Last Mile"
	quest.731A34C906EA2877.quest_desc: ["Steam in, electricity out. This is the moment Heavy Industry stops being a steam works", "and becomes a power grid - and the point where their kit can meet your FE."]
	quest.731A34C906EA2877.title: "Contract 06 - Electrification"
	quest.7383A634C9B3F5F0.quest_desc: ["The workhorse of every later recipe. Almost nothing past this point is hand-crafted."]
	quest.7383A634C9B3F5F0.title: "Contract 07 - Assembler"
	quest.73847B5EBEA613EB.quest_desc: ["Two units are not a system until they are connected.", "Run Refrigerant Pipe between the Indoor and Outdoor Unit."]
	quest.73847B5EBEA613EB.title: "Site Works - Refrigerant Run"
	quest.73B0DDC64A8657AD.quest_desc: ["The assembly that holds fissile fuel inside the casing."]
	quest.73B0DDC64A8657AD.title: "Nuclear Licence 02 - Fuel Column"
	quest.759CFF3C0E3580ED.quest_desc: ["Combines items in a basin below it. The brass order depends on this one."]
	quest.759CFF3C0E3580ED.title: "Contract 03 - Mixing"
	quest.75FF7CA2F217076F.quest_desc: ["The warehouse is stacking crates on the floor. Start them on the upgrade path: 45 slots."]
	quest.75FF7CA2F217076F.title: "Fit-Out 01 - Copper"
	quest.761BC919DFC0EA4E.quest_desc: ["108 slots, and the last stop before the client asks for the expensive one."]
	quest.761BC919DFC0EA4E.title: "Fit-Out 04 - Diamond"
	quest.762D04711B3776A0.quest_desc: ["What comes back out of a running reactor - and the actual product.", "The reactor generates no electricity by itself, only very hot steam."]
	quest.762D04711B3776A0.title: "Coolant 02 - Steam Loop"
	quest.7672CD6D4C048480.quest_desc: ["Raw ore is not a deliverable. Smelt it to ingots, which is the form", "every downstream contract on this board is priced in."]
	quest.7672CD6D4C048480.title: "Smelt to Spec"
	quest.76DF69721AB2BB50.quest_desc: ["A fusion reactor makes plasma, not steam, and only this will drink it.", "The last contract on the board."]
	quest.76DF69721AB2BB50.title: "Fusion 05 - Plasma Turbine"
	quest.771154D20F82808F.quest_desc: ["The final audit item, and the one that decides whether any of the rest mattered.", "Racks intake at the front and exhaust at the rear - line them up so cold air and hot air", "never mix, and the site passes."]
	quest.771154D20F82808F.title: "Certification - Aisle Containment"
	quest.78BF97A8BF05E0C0.quest_desc: ["A second site has opened. The pouch is the portable end of a shared inventory."]
	quest.78BF97A8BF05E0C0.title: "Logistics 01 - Ender Pouch"
	quest.797BA966D0F2C680.quest_desc: ["Cogwork Foundry builds machines that run on rotation instead of electricity.", "Andesite alloy is their base material, and nothing on this board exists without it."]
	quest.797BA966D0F2C680.title: "Intake - Andesite Alloy"
	quest.7C84365CEEABAF9C.quest_desc: ["Zinc and copper mixed together. Everything from the Deployer up is gated behind it."]
	quest.7C84365CEEABAF9C.title: "Materials Order - Brass"
	quest.7CB64DE1AB501F07.quest_desc: ["Eight bronze plates around a frame. Every steam-era machine needs one as its shell."]
	quest.7CB64DE1AB501F07.title: "Groundwork - Machine Casing"
	quest.7CC2A58355603902.quest_desc: ["Smelt quartz dust into silicon: the substrate of every AE2 processor."]
	quest.7CC2A58355603902.title: "Intake - Silicon"
	quest.7D5B03FAA7732AB4.quest_desc: ["Free during the day, useless at night. Scales by area rather than by tier."]
	quest.7D5B03FAA7732AB4.title: "Generation 02 - Solar"
	quest.7DBD6B94391E201E.quest_desc: ["Compute is worth more as materials than as a number.", "An Advanced Synthesizer converts raw compute into physical goods -", "which is what every Standing Order on the other board is actually made of."]
	quest.7DBD6B94391E201E.title: "Contract - Materials Desk"
	quest.7F1730115684B8F2.quest_desc: ["Where the utility's whole power chain starts. Low voltage, low ambition,", "and nothing else works until it exists."]
	quest.7F1730115684B8F2.title: "Tier 01 - Low Voltage"
